Port:TermG2  N__0 0 Num=2 Z=50 Ohm notune{ 25 Ohm to 75 Ohm by 5 Ohm } noopt{ 25 Ohm to 75 Ohm } Noise=yes 

Optim:"Optim1" OptimType="random" ErrorForm="L2" SAProgressReport=0 MaxIters=40002 P=2 DesiredError=0.0 StatusLevel=4 FinalAnalysis="None" NormalizeGoals=yes SetBestValues=yes SaveSolns=yes SaveGoals=yes SaveOptimVars=no UpdateDataset=yes SaveNominal=no SaveAllIterations=no UseAllOptVars=yes UseAllGoals=no GoalName[1]="OptimGoal2" GoalName[2]="OptimGoal1" SaveCurrentEF=no InitialTempControlMode=0 SANumTrialsPerIter=10 NumShootsPerIter=20 SATempControlAlpha=0.8 EnableCockpit=yes NormalizeError=yes SaveAllTrials=no UseAdvTermCriteria=no CostRelativeTol=1.0e-8 LimitOfContSmallImprovement=5 

